# playable: the firmware the PicoCalc is left on (AGENTS.md; firmware/PLAYABLE.json records the installed build).
# The Typed apps compiled to RV32 on the handheld at boot (Chess with its delivered 3D painter, Agenda, Editor, Files)
# and on first use (the Candela scene, the Typed ray tracer in the raytrace view, and the Candela gallery's Typed
# kernel and scenes), the device compiler, and the Candela gallery (18 path-traced scenes on screen; Typed is its
# default kernel, C++ the benchmark arm). Compiled modules are kept in /files/.cache/typed (PICOCALC-COMPILE-CACHE),
# so a compile runs once per firmware and source.
SDKCONFIG_NAME=playable
SDKCONFIG_DEFAULTS=(sdkconfig.defaults sdkconfig.smooth-chess sdkconfig.reproducible)
APPS=(chess agenda editor files candela raytrace candela-gallery)
OPTIONS=(PICOCALC_DEVICE_COMPILER=ON PICOCALC_CANDELA_GALLERY=ON)
